<title>JAPAN: Chuo Bussan to issue Euroyen convertible.</title>
<headline>Chuo Bussan to issue Euroyen convertible.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Chuo Bussan Corp</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Yamaichi International (Europe) Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE Euroyen convertible ISSUE NO	  AMT   2 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON nil		   ISSU PRICE	MATURITY 30.Sep.00</p>
<p>CONV PRICE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 11.Oct.96     CONV TO 22.Sep.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY		  PAY DATE 27.Sep.96   INT PAY</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		    SIGN DATE 11.Sep.96  SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		    LAST JBRI		LAST NIS</p>
<p>The conversion price will be decided on September 11.</p>
</text>
